# Deploy source and immutable catalogs, never local credentials or player data.
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
!.env.example
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/data/runtime/**
**/data/cache/**
**/data/runtime
**/data/cache
**/data/*.tmp

# Build output, dependencies, browser artifacts, and editor state are local.
**/node_modules/**
**/node_modules
**/.next/**
**/.next
**/.vercel/**
**/.vercel
**/.git/**
**/.git
.vscode/**
**/test-results*/**
**/test-results*
**/playwright-report/**
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report/**
**/blob-report
**/coverage/**
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
